ionale": "The whole order is captured on one vertically scrolling sheet with inset grouped cards and uppercase section headers, so a florist can enter a customer order quickly during a chat/phone call without navigating multiple screens. Pink accent marks the selected chip/segment and primary actions; the sticky bottom CTA shows the live total and is disabled until at least one product exists, giving inline validation feedback."}, {"id": "screenshots_don_moi_full_inline_validation_disabled_cta", "label": "Inline Validation via Disabled CTA with Hint Text", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "screenshots/don-moi-full.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Instead of blocking with an alert on save, the form shows the first failing rule ('Th\u00eam \u00edt nh\u1ea5t m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m') directly above a dimmed save button that still displays the running total, so the user knows both why they cannot save and what the order currently amounts to."}], "edges": [{"source": "screenshots_don_moi_full_new_order_screen", "target": "screenshots_don_moi_full_customer_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/don-moi-full.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_don_moi_full_customer_section", "target": "screenshots_don_moi_full_order_source_chips", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/don-moi-full.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_don_moi_full_new_order_screen", "target": "screenshots_don_moi_full_products_section", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "screenshots/don-moi-full.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "screenshots_don_moi_full_new_order_screen", "target": "screenshots_don_moi_full_deliver